# Service API: block and message checks
error-block-as-of-invalid = The report needs a title and a heading, and its date can't be in the future. Check them and try again.
error-block-cell-too-long = A cell in that table holds too much text. Shorten it and try again.
error-block-cell-type-mismatch = A cell in that table doesn't match its column, for example text in a number column. Correct it and try again.
error-block-chart-axis-invalid = The chart's horizontal axis must be one of the table's columns, and a scatter chart needs numbers there. Change it and try again.
error-block-chart-invalid = The chart's title is empty or too long. Give it a shorter title and try again.
error-block-chart-pie-invalid = A pie chart can show one series and at most 6 rows. Use fewer rows or choose another chart type.
error-block-chart-series-invalid = The chart needs between 1 and 8 series, and each must be a number column. Adjust them and try again.
error-block-chart-too-many-points = That chart would show too many points. Use fewer rows or fewer series.
error-block-choices-invalid = The question needs 2 to 4 different choices, each short and not empty. Adjust them and try again.
error-block-currency-invalid = The currency must be a three-letter code in capitals, such as GBP. Correct it and try again.
error-block-email-not-linked = That email isn't linked to this workspace. Link the mailbox first, then try again.
error-block-field-unknown = ordin doesn't recognise part of that content. Check what was sent and try again.
error-block-figures-count = Key figures need between 1 and 8 entries. Add or remove some and try again.
error-block-figures-invalid = One of the key figures has an empty or too-long label, unit or comparison, or a value that isn't a proper number. Correct it and try again.
error-block-form-invalid = Something in that form isn't allowed, such as a missing label, a repeated name, too few options or an approval button. Correct it and try again.
error-block-kind-unknown = ordin doesn't recognise that kind of content. Use a kind it supports and try again.
error-block-link-not-allowed = A web address was given where ordin expected a reference to something in your work. Use the reference instead.
error-block-offer-unknown = The result needs a short summary and one of the offered next steps. Choose from the list and try again.
error-block-path-invalid = That file location isn't valid. Use a relative location that doesn't start with a slash or go up a folder.
error-block-ref-unresolved = ordin can't find that reference, or you don't have access to it. Check it and try again.
error-block-report-invalid = The report needs a title and a heading, and its date can't be in the future. Check them and try again.
error-block-report-parts-count = A report needs between 1 and 12 parts. Add or remove some and try again.
error-block-source-invalid = A source in the report has a missing or too-long detail. Check the sources and try again.
error-block-source-missing = Every part of the report needs a source. Add one and try again.
error-block-table-invalid = The table has a bad title or name, or two columns with the same name. Correct it and try again.
error-block-table-too-long = That table has too many rows. Keep it to 10,000 rows or fewer.
error-block-table-too-wide = That table has too many columns. Keep it to 30 columns or fewer.
error-block-text-invalid = The message is empty or too long, or has too many attachments. Shorten it or remove some attachments.
error-block-too-large = That content is too big to show. Make it smaller and try again.
error-block-too-many-items = That content has too many items. Remove some and try again.
error-svc-backend-id-malformed = ordin couldn't read the name of the place you're connected to. Reconnect and try again.
error-svc-backend-unknown = That isn't the place you're connected to. Reconnect and try again.
error-svc-body-too-large = That is too big to send. Make it smaller and try again.
error-svc-command-local-only = That can only be done on the computer where ordin is installed.
error-svc-command-unknown = ordin doesn't recognise that action. Update ordin or try something else.
error-svc-event-gap = Some updates were missed. ordin will refresh what you see.
error-svc-event-invalid = An update arrived in a form ordin couldn't read, so it was skipped. Try again.
error-svc-event-too-large = An update was too big to pass on, so it was skipped. Try again with less.
error-svc-input-invalid = Something in what was sent isn't valid. Check it and try again.
error-svc-not-in-this-version = This version of ordin can't do that. Update ordin and try again.
error-svc-request-id-malformed = ordin couldn't read the label on that action. Try again.
error-svc-version-malformed = The version numbers sent are out of range. Update ordin and try again.
error-svc-version-unsupported = This version of ordin can't work with the one it's talking to. Update ordin and try again.
